  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a January 2026 statement, Assistant Secretary for Postsecondary Education David Barker said the administration is reenvisioning higher education around student success, workforce readiness, and adaptation to new technology. In May 2026, he described grant investments with the Department of Labor as creating a modernized system more responsive to labor market needs and bridging employment and education.",
